title: Day 2 begins
new-page: true

- @option_intro_1: Another day comes to an end...

@option_intro_1
subtitle: ...and another one begins anew.
new-page: true

= Another early morning

You wake up rather early in the morning once again as the sun is yet to be visible above the horizon. 

That makes it two-in-a-row, then. A new record, huh?

Taking a glance at the clock, you notice that there is still quite some time left before you have to go to the Royal Palace. As you prepare for the day, your mind begins wandering about...

- @the_news: The news.

@the_news

...Yeah. The headline-grabbing news that appeared just yesterday morning.

Truth be told, it's neither the most insane thing you've ever heard in your entire life, nor is it the most far-fetched. Actually, that is also partially why the news had been so shocking to read about at first.

Princess Darlyne did mention a bit about the chaos from a while back. Though it was quite some time before you got into this role, you've heard about it from the newspapers and some of your past lecturers talking about them.

You don't exactly remember much, but there was a major controversy involving Princess Darlyne's alchemy research with several nobles who disapprove of some of her actions. The nobles eventually backed down after some sort of settlement, but even now you could still see some unresolved tensions between them.

Deep inside, your biggest hope is for the news to die down soon, one way or another. There is no telling what would happen if whatever happens next explodes way beyond any of your control.

- @next_up: And then...

@next_up

Before you realize it, the sun is already well and above the horizon, and the sky has already turned a rather bright blue.

You quickly finish up your preparation before heading towards the door. Everything is nicely put into the bag, and you are now ready to go.

- @head_out: It's time to head out.

@head_out
new-page: true

- @newspaper_1: The morning newspaper has arrived!

@newspaper_1
subtitle: You wonder whether another news could snatch the headline away.
new-page: true

The morning newspaper arrives in front of the door right as you are about to head out. You decide to pick it up to read what the headline said.

- @headline: And the headline reads...

@headline
## audio: 

= PRINCESS CAUGHT IN A WEB OF AFFAIRS!

- @no_way: ...There is no way.

@no_way

"...There's no way." 

You squint your eyes as you read through the headline, and then following it up with a scan through the articles below.

Somehow, true to your worst expectation, the news has survived the day. Even worse, it snatches up another headline.

- @no_way_2: There's no way it could get any worse.

@no_way_2

You shake your head once more. There is no way this could get any worse, right?

At least... that was until you spot the paragraph on the bottom-left corner of the article.

*Multiple victims of these cases of infidelity which the Princess is being accused to be complicit of have also revealed to have been under the protection of several noble families. It is not inconceivable to say that her status as a member of royalty may turn out to be far more precarious than it was from the last incident.*

Fear begins to creep in as the weight of this impending crisis slowly dawns upon you.

- @noble_involved: So... what next?

@noble_involved

The news will grow bigger, and it will soon turn into an unstoppable catastrophe. For the princess, for the Royal Family, for *you*, and for the fate of the Kingdom itself.

This situation has a very clear direction on where it is going next, and you're quite sure that it will *not* be for the best.

Quickly, you fold the newspaper into the bag as you run as fast as you can towards the nearest carriage to the Royal Palace.

- @second_meet

@second_meet
